export anchor FeltPatchesStyle:
    number: 105
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Felt patches
    idea: The dashboard is a craft fair table of cut felt shapes, each sewn down with a running stitch, so numbers sit in round badges and progress is a line of thread.
    base: light
    palette:
        linen: #efe6d4, the page, with a faint woven crosshatch
        creamFelt: #f8f1e2, project patches, the activity strip, the chart patch, the search and the sheet
        tealFelt: #2f6a6b, the sidebar ribbon, thread progress and this week columns, white text
        mustardFelt: #d9a93a, the current tab, the bell and last week columns, dark text only
        sageFelt: #a9c3a4, the greeting pennant and the avatar, dark text
        roseFelt: #9c3d4e, the primary button, the overdue badge and activity bullets, white text
        bark: #2f2a24, text, stitches and the focus outline
        twine: #5e5348, meta lines and times
        okTint: #dfe9dc, the On track chip with #23524f text
        riskTint: #f3e2b8, the At risk chip with #6e4d00 text
        badTint: #f1d9dd, the Behind chip with #82283a text
    type:
        Two stacks. Text uses Gill Sans, Gill Sans MT, Trebuchet MS,
        Calibri, Segoe UI. The greeting and section titles use Iowan Old
        Style, Georgia, Times New Roman in italic 600. The greeting is 40px
        at 1.1, badge numbers 52px serif bold, section titles 28px, patch
        titles 19px humanist bold, body 17px at 1.5, meta 14px.
    layout:
        A 220px teal felt ribbon on the left holds the brand with a star
        button logo and six nav tabs cut as cream felt with uneven corners,
        the current one mustard with a heart. The main column starts with
        a cream felt search pill, a rose New project button, a round
        mustard bell and a sage MO circle. The greeting is a wide sage felt
        pennant with a notched right end, Good morning, Mara in italic serif,
        the date, and a small cream tag in rose that says 4 tasks are overdue
        with a diamond. The four numbers are round stitched felt badges in
        teal, mustard, rose and cream, two of them slightly wobbly. Below,
        Projects on the table shows six cream patches two across, each cut
        with different corner radii and tilted under one degree, with the
        name, meta, a thread progress line ending in a button knot, the
        percent in serif and a status chip. On the right, Around the table
        is a cream felt strip of six activity rows with rose dots, then a
        felt chart patch with 14 rounded columns outlined by a dashed stitch.
        Below 1040px the ribbon becomes a top band with wrapped tabs. Below
        640px badges go two by two and patches go one across.
    spacing: An 8px unit. Patches pad 22px, gaps of 20 and 32px.
    density: Relaxed. Two patches across with plenty of linen between.
    corners: Uneven hand cut radii between 10 and 34px, every patch different. Badges are circles or slightly squashed circles.
    borders: No outer border. A 2px dashed running stitch sits 7px inside every felt shape, pale on dark felt.
    shadows: A soft 6px blur under each patch and a 2px lip, like felt resting on cloth. Felt carries a fine speckled texture.
    icons:
        Filled craft shapes at about 22px. A two hole button for On track,
        a triangle with a mark for At risk, a square with a stitched cross
        for Behind and a diamond with a mark for overdue, always with the
        word.
    focus: A 3px dashed bark outline offset 4px inside a soft 10px mustard halo. A focused field turns its dashed edge solid.
    tone: Warm and handmade, such as Around the table and Good morning.
